1	line	Player	I am questing for the Holy Grail.
1	line	Sir Lancelot	The Grail? Ha! Frankly, friend, you're not in that league.
1	line	Player	Why do you say that?
1	line	Sir Lancelot	You got lucky with freeing Merlin but there's no way a puny wannabe like you is going to find the Holy Grail where so many others have failed.
1	line	Player	We'll see about that.
1	action	end
