0	section	Talking to The Fisher King
1	line	The Fisher King	Ah! You got inside at last! You spent all that time fumbling around outside, I thought you'd never make it here.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	How did you know what I have been doing?
2	line	Player	How did you know what I have been doing?
2	line	The Fisher King	Oh, I can see what is happening in my realm. I have sent clues to help you get here, such as the fisherman, and the crone.
2	action	initial
1	option	I seek the Holy Grail.
2	line	Player	I seek the Holy Grail.
2	line	The Fisher King	Ah excellent. A knight come to seek the Holy Grail. Maybe our land can be restored to its former glory.
2	line	The Fisher King	At the moment the Grail cannot be removed from the castle. Legend has it a questing knight will one day work out how to restore our land; then he will claim the Grail as his prize.
2	line	Player	Any ideas how I can restore the land?
2	line	The Fisher King	None at all.
2	select	Select an option
2	option	You don't look too well.
3	line	Player	You don't look too well.
3	line	The Fisher King	Nope, I don't feel so good either.
3	line	The Fisher King	I fear my life is running short... Alas, my son and heir is not here. I am waiting for my son to return to this castle.
3	line	The Fisher King	If you could find my son, that would be a great weight off my shoulders.
3	line	Player	Who is your son?
3	line	The Fisher King	He is known as Percival.
3	line	The Fisher King	I believe he is a knight of the round table.
3	line	Player	I shall go and see if I can find him.
3	action	end
2	option	Do you mind if I have a look around?
3	line	Player	Do you mind if I have a look around?
3	line	The Fisher King	No, not at all. Please, be my guest.
3	action	end
1	option	You don't look too well.
2	action	above
