1	line	King Arthur	He was going to try and recover the golden boots of Arkaneeses.
1	line	Player	Any idea which way that would be?
1	line	King Arthur	Not exactly. We discovered some magic golden feathers that are said to point the way to the boots...
1	line	King Arthur	They certainly point somewhere.
1	line	King Arthur	Just blowing gently on them will supposedly show the way to go.
